he Christmas Eve concert, is scolded, and the missing M&M agency's star singer, Menou Akiyama, is discovered. Eiji then stands before a painting after winning the spoils of war in his \"mobilization value\" bet.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p0Lni3xnN2tN7nGZxu4XqEsUk2i.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 14","synopsis":"After the Christmas Eve concert, Touya's father collapses, due to a longstanding condition, and is hospitalized. The next day, Yuki goes to visit him but missed Touya on his way out. Itsuki Kanzaki, after blowing off the Christmas Eve concert, is scolded, and the missing M&M agency's star singer, Menou Akiyama, is discovered. Eiji then stands before a painting after winning the spoils of war in his \"mobilization value\" bet.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p0Lni3xnN2tN7nGZxu4XqEsUk2i.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 15","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6970","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6165","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6165","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"28502","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84553","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[15]}],"link":"14992","synopsis":"After Eiji stops giving Yuki her lesson, she decides to stop by and visit Touya's father in the hospital. On New Years Eve, Yuki goes to Touya's apartment. The two bring in the new year kissing. This is how 1987 begins...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dRqeH09UKXKuoGRTTKAtunAVTA2.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 15","synopsis":"After Eiji stops giving Yuki her lesson, she decides to stop by and visit Touya's father in the hospital. On New Years Eve, Yuki goes to Touya's apartment. The two bring in the new year kissing. This is how 1987 begins...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dRqeH09UKXKuoGRTTKAtunAVTA2.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 16","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6970","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6165","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6165","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"28502","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84553","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[16]}],"link":"14991","synopsis":"Touya's father planned to spend the New Year's holiday at home, but his condition suddenly worsens and he has to return to the hospital. Touya is saddened and disappointed in his father's condition. A few days later, a meeting is held at Ogata Productions. It is about the Venus Festival, a musical competition for young female singers which is held every February. Rina has never been given a chance to enter it before... The rule is set that each production company may only send one group or singer to the competition. Rina, realizing what was going on in Eiji's mind, suddenly declares she is going independence, and walks out...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k97nuYcf0FhY8joJSR18QlRroq0.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 16","synopsis":"Touya's father planned to spend the New Year's holiday at home, but his condition suddenly worsens and he has to return to the hospital. Touya is saddened and disappointed in his father's condition. A few days later, a meeting is held at Ogata Productions. It is about the Venus Festival, a musical competition for young female singers which is held every February. Rina has never been given a chance to enter it before... The rule is set that each production company may only send one group or singer to the competition. Rina, realizing what was going on in Eiji's mind, suddenly declares she is going independence, and walks out...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k97nuYcf0FhY8joJSR18QlRroq0.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 17","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6970","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6165","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6165","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"28502","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84553","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[17]}],"link":"14987","synopsis":"Upon declaring independence from Ogata Productions, Rina leaves. Yuki chases her in the rain and desperately begs her to return. Rina has made up her mind and will not be convinced to go back. After regaining her composure, Yuki reminisces about recording White Album with Rina... While this is going on, Eiji is paid a visit by Itsuki and a consultant sent to regain a picture that wasn't theirs to give away. However, this is really just one of Itsuki's plots... Eiji offers his Tri-Sad studio, but the price won't cover the painting...So what will Eiji offer to pay for it...?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aVcOAcKik1h1WnqaXBZLIheg6e7.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 17","synopsis":"Upon declaring independence from Ogata Productions, Rina leaves. Yuki chases her in the rain and desperately begs her to return. Rina has made up her mind and will not be convinced to go back. After regaining her composure, Yuki reminisces about recording White Album with Rina... While this is going on, Eiji is paid a visit by Itsuki and a consultant sent to regain a picture that wasn't theirs to give away. However, this is really just one of Itsuki's plots... Eiji offers his Tri-Sad studio, but the price won't cover the painting...So what will Eiji offer to pay for it...?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aVcOAcKik1h1WnqaXBZLIheg6e7.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 18","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6970","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6165","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6165","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"28502","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84553","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[18]}],"link":"14988","synopsis":"It is revealed, at a press conference, that Rina will be transferring to Itsuki Kanzaki's rival agency, M&MM. In the same press conference, Sakuradan announces that they are disbanding and that their vice-leader, Sarii, will be going solo. Yuki visits Touya's father in the hospital by herself. The two begin to discuss his son... Touya goes to the dressing room at the TV station to catch Rina after she finishes her last gig for Ogata Productions. Rina tries to put up a strong front, but melts in Touya's arms when he puts them around her. \"Kiss me, Fuji-kun.\"","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2FWn4xmgsRGn8sv59V1otSY3Is1.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 18","synopsis":"It is revealed, at a press conference, that Rina will be transferring to Itsuki Kanzaki's rival agency, M&MM. In the same press conference, Sakuradan announces that they are disbanding and that their vice-leader, Sarii, will be going solo. Yuki visits Touya's father in the hospital by herself. The two begin to discuss his son... Touya goes to the dressing room at the TV station to catch Rina after she finishes her last gig for Ogata Productions. Rina tries to put up a strong front, but melts in Touya's arms when he puts them around her. \"Kiss me, Fuji-kun.\"","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2FWn4xmgsRGn8sv59V1otSY3Is1.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 19","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6970","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6165","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6165","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"28502","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84553","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[19]}],"link":"14990","synopsis":"Rina informs Yuki directly that her and Touya just kissed after showing up at her dressing room. To muddy the waters further, Touya joins Rina at M&MM as her assistant. After this devastating blow, Yuki tries to distract herself from the pain by biting her wrist as she hears Rina's painful words. The next week, as Rina and Touya begin their job at M&MM, Itsuki orders the two of them to sit in on Menou's recording session. At the studio, Touya makes the connection that Menou is the girl he met outside the Yunagi Koukaidou on the night of the Christmas Eve concert. Menou seems to care less about her actual album and lets Rina handle the recording while she chats with Touya...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fPyfpgEgvXFnTmMvmOTumnMfZrj.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 19","synopsis":"Rina informs Yuki directly that her and Touya just kissed after showing up at her dressing room. To muddy the waters further, Touya joins Rina at M&MM as her assistant. After this devastating blow, Yuki tries to distract herself from the pain by biting her wrist as she hears Rina's painful words. The next week, as Rina and Touya begin their job at M&MM, Itsuki orders the two of them to sit in on Menou's recording session. At the studio, Touya makes the connection that Menou is the girl he met outside the Yunagi Koukaidou on the night of the Christmas Eve concert. Menou seems to care less about her actual album and lets Rina handle the recording while she chats with Touya...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fPyfpgEgvXFnTmMvmOTumnMfZrj.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 20","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6970","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6165","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6165","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"28502","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[20]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84553","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[20]}],"link":"14999","synopsis":"Touya returns to his hometown, only to find Menou waiting for him. She's acting like she owns the place when a staffmember from the agency comes to retrieve her. Eiji determines that the picture of a girl he received from Itsuki is a forgery and continues his search for the real one. Eiji is having delusions about what is really in the pictures, but Yuki sets him straight. Rina, meanwhile, has a nearly empty schedule. With Touya at her side, she undergoes a bunch of voluntary training. And, of course, Touya and Yayoi's affair continues on...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9wFDlmvukgE5ZSJy2qBYlkO9Ebg.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 20","synopsis":"Touya returns to his hometown, only to find Menou waiting for him. She's acting like she owns the place when a staffmember from the agency comes to retrieve her. Eiji determines that the picture of a girl he received from Itsuki is a forgery and continues his search for the real one. Eiji is having delusions about what is really in the pictures, but Yuki sets him straight. Rina, meanwhile, has a nearly empty schedule. With Touya at her side, she undergoes a bunch of voluntary training. And, of course, Touya and Yayoi's affair continues on...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9wFDlmvukgE5ZSJy2qBYlkO9Ebg.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 21","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumbe